    "body": "Thank you for this request and the clear \"Done means\" list.\n\nTriage: **P6** (accepted enhancement), **effort:high**, **area:3d**, **area:ui**. It changes toolpath generation, so it gets the safety-level review (no-gouge check at angles other than 0 and 90 too). The angle change must also go through the undoable parameter command and get its MCP field.\n\nIf you take it on, please comment `claimed:` with your plan.\n",
