    "updated_at": "2026-11-17T21:08:58Z",
    "body": "Thank you for this clear request, and for the \"Done means\" list.\n\nTriage: `enhancement`, `P6` (an accepted enhancement, not scheduled yet), `effort:high`, `area:3d`. The effort is high because the change alters generated toolpaths: the project's safety floor puts any toolpath change at `effort:high` or more.\n\nNotes for whoever takes it:\n- The angle must not change the default: 0 degrees gives today's path.\n- The verifier must judge the turned path the same way as today's path (no gouge, the same stock and limits) for every angle, not only 0 and 90.\n- A useful extra pin: a non-square model at 45 degrees, so the test sees the lines leave the bounding box the right way.\n\nClean-room note: please use only your own work and CamCraft's code. Do not copy text, parameter names or screenshots from Fusion 360 or HSMWorks.\n\nIf you plan to work on it yourself, a comment that starts with `claimed:` claims it.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
